+  *                    This parameter can be one of the following values:
+  *                    @arg HRTIM_OUTPUT_TA1: Timer A - Output 1
+  *                    @arg HRTIM_OUTPUT_TA2: Timer A - Output 2
+  *                    @arg HRTIM_OUTPUT_TB1: Timer B - Output 1
+  *                    @arg HRTIM_OUTPUT_TB2: Timer B - Output 2
