+  *             0  : None\n
+  *             1  : Slave (HAL I2C communication is in Slave Mode)\n
+  *          b4\n
+  *             0  : None\n
+  *             1  : Master (HAL I2C communication is in Master Mode)\n
+  *          b3-b2-b1-b0  (not used)\n
+  *             xxxx : Should be set to 0000
