+@verbatim
+ ===============================================================================
+                      ##### Peripheral Control functions #####
+ ===============================================================================
+    [..]
+    This subsection provides a set of functions allowing to:
+
+    (+) Output clock to MCO pin.
+    (+) Retrieve current clock frequencies.
+    (+) Enable the Clock Security System.
+
+@endverbatim
+  * @{
+  */
