+  *         flag to be set indicating that HSI clock is stable and can be used as
+  *         system clock source.
+  *         This parameter can be: ENABLE or DISABLE.
+  * @note   When the HSI is stopped, HSIRDY flag goes low after 6 HSI oscillator
+  *         clock cycles.
