+/** @brief Ensure that SMARTCARD frame RX/TX pins swap setting is valid.
+  * @param __SWAP__ SMARTCARD frame RX/TX pins swap setting.
+  * @retval SET (__SWAP__ is valid) or RESET (__SWAP__ is invalid)
