+  *            @arg @ref UART_FLAG_NE    Noise Error flag
+  *            @arg @ref UART_FLAG_FE    Framing Error flag
+  *            @arg @ref UART_FLAG_PE    Parity Error flag
+  * @retval The new state of __FLAG__ (TRUE or FALSE).
