+    (+) FMC NAND bank enable/disable ECC correction feature using the functions
+        FMC_NAND_ECC_Enable()/FMC_NAND_ECC_Disable()
+    (+) FMC NAND bank get ECC correction code using the function FMC_NAND_GetECC()
+
+@endverbatim
