+  *         @arg @ref LL_TIM_CHANNEL_CH4
+  *         @arg @ref LL_TIM_CHANNEL_CH5
+  *         @arg @ref LL_TIM_CHANNEL_CH6
+  * @param  Configuration This parameter must be a combination of all the following values:
